-- Source module: Solutions.J6SegILSrc9
/-!
# B-line IL, source-table producers, part 9: pass 3 (`jSrc`, the gather)

`gthP iN`: with a list `L` (`= LJ`) on `30` (head = index 0) and `|L|` on `31` (as left by `ljP`),
and `n'` (`= G ≥ |L|`) on `iN` (`Free`): move `L` reversed onto `15` (`mvK 30 15 43 (reg 31)`),
then for `j = n' - 1, …, 0` push `0` and `code (src j)` on `44`, with
`src j = if j < |L| then some L[j] else none` (`jSrc` for `L = LJ`), moving `L[j]` back from `15`
to `30`. Output: `44 := srcTab src (fun _ => 0) n' ++ F 44`, everything else (in particular
`15, 30, 31`) unchanged. Theorem `gthP_sp`, cost `(|L| + n' + 2) * (40 * uC A DD)`.
-/

